<programme start="20261021110000 +0000" stop="20261021120000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Build That?</title><sub-title lang="en">Floating &amp; Lifting</sub-title><desc lang="en">Architects and engineers build an eco-friendly convention center on Vancouver&apos;s waterfront, a lift bridge in Bordeaux and a cocoon-shaped skyscraper in Tokyo each with unique challenges like marine habitats and massive spans.</desc><category lang="en">Instructional</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p19223615_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
